The original implementation in `DocBuilder.java` was designed to handle a single field per column, which caused issues when multiple fields were mapped to the same column name in the `DataConfig`. This limitation meant that different fields with the same column name were not processed correctly, leading to data import failures. The patch addresses this by allowing a list of fields to be associated with each column, enabling the handling of multiple fields properly.

